      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAYBE NEXT WEEK (1) looks close to another win after finishing second last time (18.15) at this track. Solid record at the distance winning 12 races. Top chance in this line up. DOTTIE KEEPING (7) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 6 lengths at Dubbo in a handy 18.05 beating Cindy's Patch. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Should feature again. SKY KEEPING (8) has a strong record this trip with six wins and four placings from 12 starts. Below best last time at Dubbo (18.67) in a NG, finishing a 8 length fourth. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. HOVERING (4) proved himself from this box last start so must be respected.",
